I can't tell if you have the fire today.
我分不清你今天有没有生火。

00:27:42.029 --> 00:27:43.029
You do?
你生了？

00:27:43.029 --> 00:27:44.029
It's a lovely fire.
这火真好看。

00:27:44.029 --> 00:27:45.029
It's a winter.
冬天嘛。

00:27:45.029 --> 00:27:46.029
There's the blue punch on it.
蓝色法国号就在那儿。

00:27:46.029 --> 00:27:47.029
It's very appealing.
